QuestGuidance.Register("es",241,{
[7681]="700718E9\n1\tExamine weathered markings\030Investigate old cloth\030Look at the broken statue\tMáladil is studying the Elderwell and has asked for your help searching the ruins for signs of the Ishâkhai.\n2\tReturn to Máladil with your findings\tYou have searched the Elderwell for signs of the Ishâkhai. Return to Máladil to inform her of your findings.\n",
[7682]="7007161E\n1\tTalk to Hidâti\tYou will need Hidâti's help to banish Ishími, the Anguished Wind. You should talk to Hidâti.\n2\tPlace Kâparai wards (total: 5)\030Heal frightened Aradûni (total: 7)\tHidâti has a plan to banish Ishími, the Anguished Wind from the Dawn-warden. You should place Kâparai wards and heal the spirits of frightened Aradûni with Hidâti.\n3\tTalk to Hidâti\tIshími has become enraged by your attempts to banish it. You should talk to Hidâti.\n4\tFind the cyclone of wind\tIshími has begun manifesting near the statue of Izighûz Menûndari. You should find the cyclone of wind near the statue.\n5\tBanish Ishími, the Anguished Wind\030(Optional) Place the final Kâparai ward\tYou must defeat the coalesced form of Ishími, the Anguished Wind to banish it from the Dawn-warden! You must place the final Kâparai ward near the cyclone to confront Ishími.\n6\tTalk to Hidâti\tIshími has successfully been banished. You should talk to Hidâti.\n7\tTalk to Captain Hanâbu\tIshími has successfully been banished. You should talk to Captain Hanâbu.\n",
[7683]="700356A7\n1\tHabla con Frithwyn\tLas personas refugiadas sobrevivientes están en su cueva al norte de Byre Tor. Deberías hablar con las personas refugiadas sobre la situación actual.\n2\tHabla con Ránmald\tRánmald está en la cueva con las otras mujeres de Byre Tor, quienes han prometido tratarla con más amabilidad. Deberías hablar con Ránmald.\n",
[7684]="70032161\n1\tEncuentra el campamento de los amigos de Isteron en Parth Galen\tLos amigos de Isteron están acampados en Parth Galen, un prado al sureste de los túneles del Bajo muro, junto a un arroyo que proviene del lago de Nen Hithoel.\n",
[7685]="7006D137\n1\tDestroy fortifications at Ghât Lor (total: 7)\tDestroy fortifications at Ghât Lor. Ghât Lor can be found to the east of Vartúlin.\n2\tReturn to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin\tReturn to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin.\n",
[7686]="70068BB5\n1\tDefeat spiders east of the city (total: 6)\030Collect Usham's satchel where he dropped it east of the city\tUsham ran afoul of spiders to the east of the city, and he asked for your help recovering the satchel he dropped here when he fled.\n2\tBring the satchel to Usham outside the Dampstone Inn\tUsham is outside the Dampstone Inn.\n3\tPlace Usham's satchel down on the table outside the inn\tUsham asked you to set his satchel down on the table outside the inn.\n4\tTalk to Usham outside the Dampstone Inn\tUsham is not happy.\n5\tLeave Usham's satchel in the wild north-east of the Dampstone Inn\tUsham no longer wants his satchel, and has asked you to leave it outside the city. Just to the north-east of the Dampstone Inn should be far enough.\n6\tReturn to Usham outside the Dampstone Inn\tNow that you have done as he asked, you should return to Usham outside the Dampstone Inn.\n7\tTalk to Maisha outside the Dampstone Inn\tMaisha has called for your attention outside the Dampstone Inn.\n",
[7687]="70017D86\n1\tHabla con Mayor Will Whitfoot\030Recoge Ithildín Coin\030Habla con Jon Brackenbrook\030Habla con Dwalin\030Habla con Barliman Butterbur\030Habla con Cardavor\tLleva tu moneda de ithildín a una de las siguientes personas para recibir una recompensa. • Jon Helecharroyo en Archet • Dwalin en la Mansión de Thorin • El alcalde Will Pieblanco en Cavada Grande • Cebadilla Mantecona en Bree • Cardavor en Celondim\n",
[7688]="700187CF\n1\tHabla con Mayor Will Whitfoot\030Recoge Ithildín Coin\030Habla con Jon Brackenbrook\030Habla con Dwalin\030Habla con Barliman Butterbur\030Habla con Cardavor\tLleva tu moneda de ithildín a una de las siguientes personas para recibir una recompensa. • Jon Helecharroyo en Archet • Dwalin en la Mansión de Thorin • El alcalde Will Pieblanco en Cavada Grande • Cebadilla Mantecona en Bree • Cardavor en Celondim\n",
[7689]="700187D0\n1\tHabla con Mayor Will Whitfoot\030Recoge Ithildín Coin\030Habla con Jon Brackenbrook\030Habla con Dwalin\030Habla con Barliman Butterbur\030Habla con Cardavor\tLleva tu moneda de ithildín a una de las siguientes personas para recibir una recompensa. • Jon Helecharroyo en Archet • Dwalin en la Mansión de Thorin • El alcalde Will Pieblanco en Cavada Grande • Cebadilla Mantecona en Bree • Cardavor en Celondim\n",
